# 降りる軸の切り口の中の輪（a と c）と、輪に入らない場（b）の同じ切り口の非単調な読み（14s）
field a : min bound 11
field b : max bound 11 5
field c : min bound 11 5
a[10] <- 1
a[9] <- 3
b[10, j] <- 3   for (j) in 0 .. 3
c[10, j] <- 3   for (j) in 0 .. 3
c[9, j] <- 3   for (j) in 0 .. 3
a[n] <- 5   for (n) in 0 .. 8 if b[n + 1, 0] < 0 if a[n + 1] != 2
c[n, j] <- b[n + 1, j] + 0   for (n) in 0 .. 9 for (j) in 1 .. 3 
c[n, j] <- 3   for (n) in 0 .. 9 for (j) in 1 .. 3 if b[n + 1, 0] != 1
c[n, j] <- a[n] + 0   for (n) in 0 .. 7 for (j) in 1 .. 3 if b[n + 2, j + 1] < 4 if a[n + 2] != 4
b[n, j] <- b[n + 1, 0] + 1   for (n) in 0 .. 9 for (j) in 1 .. 3 if a[n + 1] != 2
a[n] <- c[n, 1] + 0   for (n) in 0 .. 7 if b[n, 0] < 2 if a[n + 1] < 4
print a
print b
print c
